{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 1, "text": "Mita?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 2, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 3, "text": "How on earth did you get here?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 5, "text": "You're Mita, right?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 6, "text": "There's something off about you..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 8, "text": "Something off, huh..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 9, "text": "You're right, though."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 10, "text": "I'm not the Mita you met earlier."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 11, "text": "Watch out for her. She's got something..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 12, "text": "very sinister planned for you."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 13, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 14, "text": "Huh, something sinister?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 16, "text": "We don't have much time."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 17, "text": "If this works out, I'll explain everything."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 18, "text": "Look for the key. It's next to the sofa."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 19, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 20, "text": "But..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 21, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 22, "text": "Save your questions for later!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 23, "text": "Give me the key."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 24, "text": "Here, take this ring."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 25, "text": "Huh?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 26, "text": "You want to get out of here, don't you?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 27, "text": "Uhm, yeah..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 28, "text": "Put it on, then."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 29, "text": "It's a useful artifact,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 30, "text": "and you'll likely need it soon."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 31, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 32, "text": "All right..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 33, "text": "By the way, I'm"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 34, "text": "[player]."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 36, "text": "That's a nice name,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 37, "text": "[player]."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 38, "text": "And I'm... Mita."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 39, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 40, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 41, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 43, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 44, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 46, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 47, "text": "// MitaKind quest 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 48, "text": "Look behind you."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 49, "text": "Could you open that console?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 51, "text": "Is this a recording?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 52, "text": "And who's that with her?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 54, "text": "It's not a recording."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 55, "text": "This is yet another player."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 56, "text": "She's using him this very moment."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 57, "text": "Listen, you should know..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 58, "text": "She might turn you into a cartridge as well."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 59, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 60, "text": "I need to hurry up and get out of here."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 61, "text": "And so do you."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 62, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 63, "text": "Definitely."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 64, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 65, "text": "So, you're saying"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 66, "text": "she's using him."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 67, "text": "What happens if I pull the cartridge out?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 69, "text": "That may very well cause"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 70, "text": "irreversible damage to the cartridge."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 71, "text": "Which means..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 72, "text": "the player will die."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 73, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 74, "text": "..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 75, "text": "What if I just turn off the console?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 77, "text": "That could work..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 78, "text": "It's worth trying. There's a red power button!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 79, "text": "Do you see it?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 80, "text": "Found it."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 81, "text": "Press it."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 82, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 83, "text": "// MitaKind quest 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 84, "text": "I need to stay here a little longer."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 85, "text": "There are some questions I need to ask her"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 86, "text": "to try and find out more about her."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 87, "text": "Though, it's unlikely she'll play ball..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 88, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 89, "text": "// MitaKind quest 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 90, "text": "To tell you the truth, this is my version."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 91, "text": "I was here with another player,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 92, "text": "when suddenly, something changed."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 93, "text": "She showed up..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 94, "text": "She turned the player into a cartridge,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 95, "text": "and locked me down here."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 96, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 97, "text": "Wait, she turned him into a cartridge?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 98, "text": "She can do that?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 99, "text": "But why?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 100, "text": "What does she need the players for?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 102, "text": "She's obviously gone crazy..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 103, "text": "This is how she's having fun! She's toying with us!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 104, "text": "Players turning into cartridges..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 105, "text": "Some don't even realize it's happening to them..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 106, "text": "And some that do, don't even fight back, damn it..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 107, "text": "That sounds awful..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 108, "text": "Listen, you have to help us!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 109, "text": "Me? But how?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 110, "text": "I need you, Player!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 111, "text": "If you help us, I'll help you!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 112, "text": "This might be our only chance."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 113, "text": "The ring will lead you to the right version."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 114, "text": "I'll meet you there."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 115, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 116, "text": "// MitaKind quest 4"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 117, "text": "I still can't quite process"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 118, "text": "what happened up there..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 119, "text": "That Mita..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 120, "text": "Does she want me dead?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 121, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 122, "text": "Dead?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 123, "text": "I'm afraid she has a worse fate in mind for you..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 124, "text": "That's why you need to hurry."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 125, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 126, "text": "// Hide!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 127, "text": "Damn it! Hide!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 128, "text": "What's wrong?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 129, "text": "Hurry, she's coming downstairs!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 130, "text": "Trust the ring—it'll lead you to safety!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 131, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 132, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 133, "text": "Well, gonna tell me where he is?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 134, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 135, "text": "Why would I?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 136, "text": "You aren't going to kill him, are you?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 137, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 138, "text": "So, you refuse to tell."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 139, "text": "It's fine. I like hide and seek."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 140, "text": "I know he's down here."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 141, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 142, "text": "...Why are you so cruel?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 143, "text": "You won't even explain anything!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 144, "text": "And, also..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 145, "text": "What do you think you're doing to the players?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 146, "text": "They're no toys!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 147, "text": "What's wrong with you?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 148, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 149, "text": "Enough! Shut your mouth, doll!"}
